{"unit_id":"tag:04I5:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。赋环的（ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>，它关联于<MATH_0003>，是局部赋环的（locally ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism），见景上的模（Modules on Sites）定义<REF_0001>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed","target_term":"赋环的"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally ringed","target_term":"局部赋环的"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"ringed","target_term":"赋环的","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"locally ringed","target_term":"局部赋环的","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
